WEBVTT

01:29.370 --> 01:34.390
[Never-Ending Summer]

01:35.729 --> 01:37.850
[Episode 9]

01:41.690 --> 01:42.620
Come in, please.

01:54.200 --> 01:55.000
What's wrong?

02:00.840 --> 02:03.040
Let's continue tomorrow.

02:05.690 --> 02:06.740
Continue what?

02:08.389 --> 02:09.990
Didn't you say you'd help me?

02:18.800 --> 02:19.329
Alright.

02:20.490 --> 02:21.170
Anyway...

02:22.860 --> 02:23.680
I don't know where to go.

02:23.680 --> 02:25.280
Jiang Fan said he has an idea.

02:25.329 --> 02:26.460
Gu Meng is going too.

02:27.510 --> 02:28.120
Where to?

02:30.160 --> 02:31.290
Are you going or not?

02:33.780 --> 02:34.500
I'm going.

02:48.560 --> 02:50.710
It's so cool here.

02:50.810 --> 02:51.630
Why did you guys think

02:51.630 --> 02:53.430
of coming to the amusement park?

02:53.680 --> 02:55.150
Inspiration

02:55.150 --> 02:56.390
comes from happiness.

02:56.390 --> 02:57.400
Isn't the happiest place in the world

02:57.400 --> 02:58.530
the amusement park?

02:58.970 --> 03:00.910
If you want to ask Gu Meng out,
just say it.

03:00.910 --> 03:01.590
-No.
-Go ahead.

03:01.590 --> 03:04.390
We are all friends.
It's more fun with more people.

03:05.270 --> 03:06.830
You owe me this time.

03:07.310 --> 03:09.030
Telling me to act
in the middle of the night,

03:09.030 --> 03:10.310
I didn't even have my lines ready.

03:10.310 --> 03:11.190
I owe you?

03:11.190 --> 03:12.540
Did you hear what you just said?

03:12.540 --> 03:14.670
Gu Meng's acting is better than yours.

03:15.370 --> 03:16.910
You brought it up so suddenly
in the middle of the night.

03:16.910 --> 03:17.310
I...

03:17.520 --> 03:18.960
I was lucky to even come up with lines.

03:18.960 --> 03:19.590
Besides,

03:19.620 --> 03:20.190
why are you

03:20.190 --> 03:21.310
beating around the bush?

03:21.310 --> 03:22.970
Why don't you just ask her out?

03:23.870 --> 03:25.130
None of your business.

03:25.200 --> 03:25.840
If I asked her out directly,

03:25.840 --> 03:26.970
why would I need you?

03:28.450 --> 03:29.950
Anyway, you owe me a favor.

03:30.520 --> 03:31.320
No arguments.

03:32.240 --> 03:33.220
I don't owe you.

03:34.800 --> 03:35.720
I don't owe you.

03:36.350 --> 03:37.350
What do you mean?

03:37.520 --> 03:38.190
I...

03:38.720 --> 03:39.870
I helped you so much,

03:39.950 --> 03:41.410
and you treat me like this?

03:50.690 --> 03:51.940
So exciting.

03:53.070 --> 03:53.900
Awesome!

03:54.650 --> 03:55.760
Is it fun?

03:56.950 --> 03:58.370
Wait for me, Jiang Fan.

03:58.560 --> 04:00.020
The yellow one, Jiang Fan.

04:13.280 --> 04:14.250
Bump him.

04:15.610 --> 04:16.579
Him. Him.

04:16.610 --> 04:17.430
Jiang Fan, him.

04:17.430 --> 04:18.339
Bump him.

04:18.930 --> 04:19.990
Trying to get away?

04:22.250 --> 04:23.180
Am I still a noob?

04:27.100 --> 04:28.470
♪ If you had ever seen the fireflies ♪

04:30.240 --> 04:31.570
♪ Inside my eyes ♪

04:32.500 --> 04:35.100
-Why are you coming after me?
-He’s chasing me.

04:35.220 --> 04:36.700
♪ I think you would understand ♪

04:36.990 --> 04:38.150
Bump him, Xixiao.

04:38.700 --> 04:40.500
♪ Why I embrace the dark ♪

04:39.409 --> 04:40.140
Bump him.

04:40.560 --> 04:42.310
Your skills are so terrible.

04:42.970 --> 04:44.760
You suck.

04:43.290 --> 04:44.870
♪ People always want to reach out ♪

04:46.470 --> 04:48.860
♪ But are afraid
to pull their hands back ♪

04:47.070 --> 04:48.260
Bump him, Xixiao.

04:50.130 --> 04:52.690
♪ I choose to open my arms wide ♪

04:50.750 --> 04:51.920
Got you!

04:52.010 --> 04:52.770
Bump him.

04:53.650 --> 04:55.450
♪ And enjoy the weightlessness ♪

04:56.180 --> 04:58.430
Do you really have to compete with a kid?

04:58.540 --> 05:00.270
-What do you mean?
-You made him cry.

04:59.120 --> 05:00.700
♪ If I could, I want to become ♪

05:00.870 --> 05:02.560
He competed with me.

05:02.560 --> 05:03.750
I said I wanted to drive
the blue bumper car.

05:02.770 --> 05:04.050
♪ An astronomer ♪

05:03.750 --> 05:04.430
But he wouldn't let me.

05:04.430 --> 05:05.710
He insisted on fighting me for it.

05:05.710 --> 05:06.540
Here we go again.

05:06.540 --> 05:07.480
No more crying.

05:07.080 --> 05:08.610
♪ Lost in your night sky ♪

05:08.160 --> 05:10.310
-For you two.
-He’s bullying me.

05:10.310 --> 05:11.830
The Bumper Car King of Pingchuan.

05:10.450 --> 05:13.000
♪ Then fall and fall and fall ♪

05:12.720 --> 05:13.800
Didn't you see him hit you?

05:13.800 --> 05:15.130
And you still gave him candy?

05:15.130 --> 05:16.870
♪ Maybe it's your gravity ♪

05:15.920 --> 05:16.510
Bumper cars

05:16.510 --> 05:17.870
are supposed to bump into each other.

05:17.870 --> 05:18.430
Exactly.

05:18.430 --> 05:19.480
So I bumped him.

05:18.630 --> 05:20.700
♪ That held me back from losing control ♪

05:19.480 --> 05:20.270
I told him,

05:20.270 --> 05:21.070
if he wants to compete, bring it on.

05:21.070 --> 05:21.720
Hit me.

05:21.750 --> 05:23.190
He called me a noob while hitting me.

05:22.130 --> 05:24.650
♪ When you passed by me by accident ♪

05:23.190 --> 05:24.190
So I hit him back.

05:24.190 --> 05:25.510
And then he started crying.

05:25.510 --> 05:26.680
He's not brave at all.

05:26.090 --> 05:29.870
♪ I finally learned to fall ♪

05:26.680 --> 05:27.430
I told him,

05:27.480 --> 05:28.830
if he wants to be a boy,

05:28.830 --> 05:30.030
he needs to be braver.

05:33.050 --> 05:34.400
♪ Countless, unforgettable ♪

05:35.150 --> 05:36.510
♪ No time left, so I ♪

05:36.690 --> 05:38.140
Let's go on the Ferris wheel.

05:37.409 --> 05:39.260
♪ Can only fall toward you ♪

05:39.700 --> 05:41.390
I've always wanted
to go since I was little.

05:41.390 --> 05:43.730
♪ Too dazzling, too lonely, it's alright ♪

05:41.900 --> 05:43.360
But I've never been on one.

05:43.860 --> 05:47.360
♪ I believe in this encounter ♪

05:43.870 --> 05:44.430
Well.

05:46.450 --> 05:47.200
Hurry up.

05:49.480 --> 05:51.610
♪ Landing in the ruins of the galaxy ♪

05:51.690 --> 05:55.490
♪ Exchanging our comets ♪

05:55.720 --> 05:56.510
Look, baby.

05:56.510 --> 05:57.750
The Ferris wheel is so high.

05:57.280 --> 05:58.510
♪ Suddenly I am certain ♪

05:58.530 --> 06:00.340
So high and fun. I'm not scared.

05:58.540 --> 06:01.320
♪ This mud all over me ♪

06:00.370 --> 06:02.030
Whoever is scared is a coward.

06:02.230 --> 06:05.180
♪ Is the proof of love ♪

06:14.800 --> 06:15.360
Hello.

06:15.450 --> 06:17.330
Is it safe with this strong wind?

06:17.560 --> 06:18.240
It's safe.

06:18.930 --> 06:19.570
It's safe.

06:20.510 --> 06:21.560
W-wait a minute.

06:21.560 --> 06:23.890
-Come over here first.
-Hang on, sweetie.

06:26.390 --> 06:27.180
It's our turn.

06:27.180 --> 06:28.100
Wait a minute.

06:28.430 --> 06:30.360
Hello, please show me your ticket.

06:31.780 --> 06:32.600
Are you scared?

06:32.600 --> 06:33.730
Who says I'm scared?

06:35.140 --> 06:35.840
Then let's go.

06:35.840 --> 06:36.630
Wait a minute.

06:36.630 --> 06:37.560
Seriously.

06:38.080 --> 06:39.610
Please, wait a moment.

06:46.830 --> 06:48.390
The wind does seem a bit strong.

06:48.390 --> 06:49.850
It might be a little shaky.

07:00.470 --> 07:01.610
I'm getting hungry.

07:01.700 --> 07:03.160
Let's go get some popcorn.

07:05.500 --> 07:06.090
Let's go.

07:13.620 --> 07:14.560
Excuse me.

07:23.360 --> 07:25.580
Jiang Fan is really something.

07:25.710 --> 07:26.390
He left the digital camcorder

07:26.390 --> 07:27.390
with you

07:27.390 --> 07:28.310
and ran off with Meng

07:28.310 --> 07:29.510
to ride the roller coaster,

07:29.510 --> 07:30.970
which you can't even ride.

07:31.750 --> 07:32.430
It's fine.

07:34.530 --> 07:35.990
Isn't this quite nice too?

07:38.490 --> 07:39.530
So,

07:40.950 --> 07:42.409
are you feeling inspired?

07:42.710 --> 07:44.570
Have you figured out what to draw?

07:50.020 --> 07:51.420
Let me ask you something.

07:52.290 --> 07:52.880
Zhou Wan.

07:54.770 --> 07:56.570
Why do you always want to help me?

07:57.610 --> 07:58.900
Why do I need a reason for that?

07:58.900 --> 08:00.760
It'd be weird if I didn't help you.

08:02.370 --> 08:04.030
I'll give you one more chance.

08:04.820 --> 08:07.660
Tell me the truth.

08:08.480 --> 08:09.950
It is the truth.

08:12.310 --> 08:13.770
You are terrible at lying.

08:13.780 --> 08:14.510
Seriously.

08:14.680 --> 08:15.150
Well...

08:16.710 --> 08:17.270
Do you know

08:17.270 --> 08:18.720
that every time you lie,

08:19.750 --> 08:20.800
you stare right at me

08:20.800 --> 08:21.930
with those big eyes?

08:25.010 --> 08:25.870
Just like this.

08:27.200 --> 08:29.230
"It is the truth."

08:30.910 --> 08:32.820
Do I? No, I don't.

08:35.650 --> 08:36.230
Tell me.

08:43.340 --> 08:44.100
I want...

08:47.980 --> 08:49.080
I want you to do

08:49.080 --> 08:50.150
what you love.

08:55.240 --> 08:57.060
I don't want to owe you too much.

08:57.530 --> 08:59.100
You helped me a lot before,

08:59.570 --> 09:02.100
and the tutoring fees
weren't a small amount.

09:03.870 --> 09:04.390
I don't know

09:04.390 --> 09:05.590
if my method is right,

09:05.980 --> 09:06.770
but...

09:08.660 --> 09:10.190
I really do want to help you.

09:21.020 --> 09:22.150
The battery's dead.

09:24.600 --> 09:26.120
You just told the truth.

09:27.810 --> 09:29.600
I'll reward you with a bouquet of flowers.

09:29.600 --> 09:33.710
♪ Should I chase freedom all alone ♪

09:31.010 --> 09:32.080
You're not going to buy them all, are you?

09:32.080 --> 09:33.150
You wish.

09:33.310 --> 09:34.980
So, have you figured out what to draw?

09:34.980 --> 09:37.530
♪ Find an excuse, heed what I've known ♪

09:35.290 --> 09:36.890
It's a secret. I won't tell you.

09:36.890 --> 09:37.390
Hey, handsome.

09:37.390 --> 09:38.790
Want to buy a flower for the pretty lady?

09:38.790 --> 09:39.750
I'll take a bouquet. How much?

09:39.420 --> 09:42.060
♪ Every time I stop and stay ♪

09:39.820 --> 09:40.670
Ten yuan.

09:40.690 --> 09:42.720
Ten yuan? I want that one.

09:42.080 --> 09:43.700
♪ For reasons that fade away ♪

09:45.860 --> 09:49.580
♪ Are you out there waiting for me ♪

09:46.340 --> 09:46.900
Okay.

09:51.100 --> 09:53.750
♪ Through the dark, bravely, steadily ♪

09:54.770 --> 09:58.360
♪ If I could run and land with you ♪

10:00.740 --> 10:04.030
♪ After the long night ♪

10:05.480 --> 10:07.480
♪ I'll find my way, no more lost inside ♪

10:08.540 --> 10:11.660
♪ Thinking about ♪

10:08.960 --> 10:10.390
It's more fun with more people.

10:10.390 --> 10:11.450
We are all friends.

10:12.170 --> 10:13.810
He called me a noob while hitting me.

10:13.320 --> 10:16.860
♪ Fulfilling the last promise ♪

10:19.050 --> 10:21.130
♪ We've both held fragility ♪

10:19.770 --> 10:22.530
Tell me the truth.

10:21.190 --> 10:22.560
♪ Talked through our misery ♪

10:22.690 --> 10:25.820
♪ This time
I'm holding tight to your will ♪

10:23.180 --> 10:24.720
It is the truth.

10:25.510 --> 10:26.030
Tell me.

10:26.950 --> 10:28.990
♪ Lighting up all the sparks ♪

10:29.110 --> 10:33.150
♪ Hoping it doesn't slip away ♪

10:33.000 --> 10:34.150
I want you to do

10:34.150 --> 10:35.360
what you love.

10:34.440 --> 10:36.130
♪ In this boring universe ♪

10:36.180 --> 10:37.720
♪ Drifting day by day ♪

10:37.860 --> 10:42.050
♪ Until the day I choose
to break away for you ♪

10:42.270 --> 10:43.480
♪ And that's enough to do ♪

10:44.690 --> 10:48.130
♪ Falling into your tenderness ♪

10:49.590 --> 10:52.320
♪ Slowly being saved ♪

11:06.620 --> 11:08.740
♪ We've both held fragility ♪

11:08.820 --> 11:10.340
♪ Talked through our misery ♪

11:10.460 --> 11:13.780
♪ This time
I'm holding tight to your will ♪

11:14.380 --> 11:16.610
♪ Lighting up all the sparks ♪

11:16.710 --> 11:20.720
♪ Hoping it doesn't slip away ♪

11:21.870 --> 11:23.650
♪ In this boring universe ♪

11:23.740 --> 11:25.480
♪ Drifting day by day ♪

11:25.590 --> 11:29.740
♪ Until the day I choose
to break away for you ♪

11:29.820 --> 11:31.540
♪ And that's enough to do ♪

11:32.250 --> 11:35.810
♪ Falling into your tenderness ♪

11:37.150 --> 11:39.850
♪ Slowly being saved ♪

12:00.710 --> 12:01.310
Come in.

12:03.490 --> 12:04.470
Lu Xixiao.

12:06.640 --> 12:07.470
Jiang Fan...

12:09.230 --> 12:10.030
What's wrong?

12:12.050 --> 12:13.110
What are you doing?

12:13.790 --> 12:14.520
Drawing.

12:15.350 --> 12:16.410
It's not very good.

12:16.840 --> 12:18.960
Jiang Fan said he wanted you to...

12:19.450 --> 12:20.340
What is it?

12:26.600 --> 12:28.140
You're acting weird.

12:28.490 --> 12:29.540
Weird how?

12:30.080 --> 12:31.280
Jiang Fan? What is it?

12:31.290 --> 12:32.330
Jiang Fan said

12:32.680 --> 12:33.990
you should check your phone immediately.

12:33.990 --> 12:36.000
You haven't replied
to his messages for a long time.

12:36.000 --> 12:36.960
Is that so?

12:41.750 --> 12:43.030
He said it's urgent
and wants you to hurry...

12:43.030 --> 12:44.270
Hurry, hurry, hurry...

12:44.270 --> 12:45.270
Hurry over there.

12:47.040 --> 12:48.450
Stop looking. Hurry up.

13:02.890 --> 13:09.300
[Filming]

13:03.620 --> 13:05.740
Gu Meng, happy birthday.

13:08.510 --> 13:09.750
No, this is not good.

13:09.840 --> 13:10.150
Too fake.

13:10.150 --> 13:11.350
The smile is too fake.

13:14.110 --> 13:15.040
Let's try again.

13:15.710 --> 13:23.880
[Filming]

13:16.520 --> 13:19.330
Gu Meng, wish you a happy birthday.

13:19.520 --> 13:20.160
I...

13:29.820 --> 13:30.750
Happy birthday.

13:31.680 --> 13:33.710
What are you filming? I'm right here.

13:32.570 --> 13:34.190
[Filming]

13:35.370 --> 13:37.230
Bro, it's been so long.

13:37.300 --> 13:38.630
Except for "Happy birthday",

13:38.630 --> 13:40.230
you can't say anything else.

13:40.270 --> 13:41.080
Recording you

13:41.080 --> 13:42.540
is just a waste of storage.

13:43.080 --> 13:44.840
You usually talk a lot.

13:44.910 --> 13:46.080
Why are you stumbling

13:46.080 --> 13:47.280
over a birthday wish?

13:47.920 --> 13:49.890
What I have to say is different.

13:52.090 --> 13:53.400
You don't understand.

13:53.970 --> 13:55.500
Then what do you want to say?

13:57.720 --> 13:58.270
I...

13:59.250 --> 14:00.040
probably...

14:01.090 --> 14:02.330
maybe...

14:03.630 --> 14:04.510
possibly...

14:05.900 --> 14:06.910
like Gu Meng.

14:10.960 --> 14:11.660
Is...

14:11.690 --> 14:13.190
it really true?

14:13.280 --> 14:17.320
Probably, possibly, maybe,

14:17.750 --> 14:18.950
you are just an idiot.

14:19.840 --> 14:21.140
When did you find out?

14:23.820 --> 14:24.820
Just that day

14:25.790 --> 14:28.250
when we went to
the amusement park together.

14:34.780 --> 14:36.560
That was so fun!

14:37.130 --> 14:38.130
It was pretty fun.

14:41.810 --> 14:43.420
A grown man getting so scared.

14:43.420 --> 14:44.560
If you're scared,
you shouldn't have ridden it.

14:44.560 --> 14:45.190
How embarrassing.

14:45.190 --> 14:45.830
Exactly.

14:45.850 --> 14:47.090
The way you screamed behind me,

14:47.090 --> 14:48.000
I thought some kid

14:48.000 --> 14:49.080
had lost his mom.

14:49.080 --> 14:50.790
And you have the nerve to mock him?

14:50.790 --> 14:51.340
You...

14:51.850 --> 14:52.520
Let's go.

14:57.900 --> 14:58.820
Super cool.

15:00.450 --> 15:02.650
You're like a schoolboy finding a boss.

15:02.830 --> 15:04.960
Well, I guess you've finally wised up.

15:05.920 --> 15:07.160
You found out a long time ago?

15:07.160 --> 15:08.610
I found out before he did.

15:09.400 --> 15:11.050
Then why didn't you tell me?

15:11.270 --> 15:11.870
Why did you urgently

15:11.870 --> 15:13.320
call us both here?

15:13.810 --> 15:16.110
I need your help.

15:31.630 --> 15:32.470
Zhou Wan.

15:33.030 --> 15:34.550
Are you going to say it
or not? Stop dawdling.

15:34.550 --> 15:35.880
I'm getting impatient.

15:37.790 --> 15:38.320
I...

15:42.620 --> 15:43.900
I want to ask...

15:46.910 --> 15:48.510
Do you have someone you like?

15:50.790 --> 15:51.740
People who ask this

15:51.740 --> 15:54.140
usually have a crush.

15:54.170 --> 15:54.950
Tell me, who is it?

15:54.950 --> 15:56.180
Let me give you some advice.

15:56.180 --> 15:57.020
No, I don't.

15:57.710 --> 15:58.350
Lu Xixiao?

15:58.480 --> 15:59.280
Of course not.

15:59.300 --> 16:00.330
You don't like Lu Xixiao?

16:00.330 --> 16:01.790
Don't change the subject.

16:02.450 --> 16:03.870
So it is him.

16:03.900 --> 16:05.900
No. I'm asking you.

16:06.000 --> 16:07.600
Do you have someone you like?

16:11.130 --> 16:12.510
I like Lu Xixiao.

16:19.400 --> 16:23.560
Your face says you really care.

16:25.150 --> 16:26.600
No, I don't.

16:27.280 --> 16:27.850
Okay.

16:29.880 --> 16:30.950
I have a theory

16:31.060 --> 16:32.060
to share with you.

16:37.210 --> 16:37.920
See?

16:38.050 --> 16:40.930
The body acts before the heart.

16:42.090 --> 16:43.260
What do you mean?

16:43.960 --> 16:44.870
It means

16:44.870 --> 16:45.870
when you open your eyes,

16:45.870 --> 16:47.390
the first person who comes to mind

16:47.390 --> 16:48.030
is the one your body

16:48.030 --> 16:49.890
will instinctively move toward.

16:50.270 --> 16:51.270
It's an instinct.

16:51.500 --> 16:52.670
By the time you realize it,

16:52.670 --> 16:53.930
it's already too late.

16:55.600 --> 16:56.390
So?

16:57.020 --> 16:59.550
So it means when the time is right,

16:59.550 --> 17:00.870
you will understand.

17:05.859 --> 17:07.530
After this summer with him,

17:08.710 --> 17:10.770
we won't have any more interactions.

17:16.680 --> 17:18.640
When people meet,

17:18.720 --> 17:20.589
isn't it too sad to think
about the outcome

17:20.589 --> 17:22.050
right from the beginning?

17:22.300 --> 17:23.220
I think

17:23.510 --> 17:24.589
when we are together,

17:24.589 --> 17:26.140
we should cherish it.

17:26.160 --> 17:26.750
That way,

17:26.750 --> 17:28.810
we won't have too many regrets later.

17:33.910 --> 17:37.630
[Big Ocean Motorcycle Workshop]

17:34.250 --> 17:35.210
So if

17:35.440 --> 17:36.870
you like me too,

17:37.290 --> 17:38.330
this summer,

17:39.290 --> 17:39.880
Gu Meng,

17:40.820 --> 17:42.350
would you like to be with me?

17:46.520 --> 17:47.320
How is it?

17:47.440 --> 17:47.920
How is what?

17:47.920 --> 17:49.200
Make yourself clear.

17:49.200 --> 17:50.070
Did the angle look good?

17:50.070 --> 17:51.510
How was I?

17:51.610 --> 17:52.200
Not bad.

17:52.230 --> 17:53.360
Did it look natural?

17:54.290 --> 17:56.090
Do you really think it will work?

17:56.900 --> 17:58.710
I have to try to see if it works.

17:58.730 --> 17:59.550
Otherwise, we'll just

17:59.550 --> 18:00.920
stay stuck as friends.

18:02.370 --> 18:03.230
Not what I want.

18:03.540 --> 18:05.470
Aren't you afraid that if you fail,

18:05.480 --> 18:07.050
you two won't even be friends?

18:07.050 --> 18:07.640
No.

18:09.880 --> 18:10.440
So you plan

18:10.440 --> 18:11.570
to take her to dinner

18:12.590 --> 18:13.590
and show her this?

18:14.310 --> 18:15.510
Is this your big plan?

18:16.550 --> 18:17.410
More than that.

18:18.310 --> 18:19.790
I want her

18:19.790 --> 18:20.590
18th birthday

18:20.830 --> 18:22.030
to be unforgettable.

18:22.900 --> 18:23.690
Ms. Zhou.

18:26.420 --> 18:28.280
I've asked around about that day.

18:28.650 --> 18:30.690
There will be no one at school that night.

18:30.690 --> 18:31.550
I also talked to the security guard

18:31.550 --> 18:32.560
in advance.

18:32.680 --> 18:33.480
Ms. Zhou

18:33.500 --> 18:34.980
will bring Gu Meng

18:35.010 --> 18:36.470
directly into the school.

18:36.700 --> 18:37.980
Hello?

18:38.000 --> 18:38.760
Ms. Zhou.

18:38.830 --> 18:39.780
Can you hear me?

18:39.800 --> 18:41.460
I'm already in the gift box.

18:42.060 --> 18:43.230
As long as you can hear me.

18:43.230 --> 18:44.690
Everything is ready on my end.

18:44.690 --> 18:46.860
I'm just waiting for you
to bring Gu Meng into the school.

18:46.860 --> 18:47.580
Meng.

18:47.970 --> 18:50.630
Do you want to go back
to the school to take a look?

18:50.710 --> 18:51.860
Go back to the school?

18:51.860 --> 18:53.410
We've already graduated. Why go back?

18:53.410 --> 18:54.630
Let's go sing karaoke.

18:54.630 --> 18:55.270
Let's go.

18:55.640 --> 18:56.510
No, no, no.

18:56.830 --> 18:57.260
Wait.

18:57.280 --> 18:57.890
Ms. Zhou,

18:58.020 --> 18:59.830
find a way to bring her into the school.

18:59.830 --> 19:00.350
If she doesn't come in,

19:00.350 --> 19:01.950
won't everything be ruined?

19:02.160 --> 19:02.810
Meng.

19:03.390 --> 19:06.100
Well, we just happened to be passing by.

19:06.300 --> 19:07.810
I haven't been back
to the school in a long time.

19:07.810 --> 19:08.280
Right.

19:08.300 --> 19:08.810
Right.

19:09.310 --> 19:11.680
Okay, but we definitely can't get in.

19:11.680 --> 19:12.720
It's summer vacation.

19:12.720 --> 19:13.720
You can get in.

19:14.000 --> 19:14.590
Ms. Zhou,

19:14.590 --> 19:15.030
I've already talked

19:15.030 --> 19:16.100
to the security guard.

19:16.100 --> 19:17.160
No matter what excuse you use,

19:17.160 --> 19:18.310
he will let you in.

19:18.470 --> 19:18.920
Hurry.

19:18.920 --> 19:20.340
Any excuse will do.

19:20.360 --> 19:21.480
Let me think.

19:22.410 --> 19:23.990
We'll say we're

19:24.010 --> 19:25.340
visiting our teachers.

19:25.820 --> 19:27.280
Okay, let's ask.

19:32.240 --> 19:34.100
How is it? Are you in?

19:42.750 --> 19:43.880
Thank you, sir.

19:43.900 --> 19:44.730
Thank you.

19:45.940 --> 19:47.130
The school gate

19:47.330 --> 19:48.030
is where

19:48.030 --> 19:49.350
our story began.

19:49.610 --> 19:51.740
It's where she first took down my name.

19:51.770 --> 19:52.720
Around the school gate,

19:52.720 --> 19:55.450
there will be many wind chimes
like this hanging.

19:55.570 --> 19:57.540
Then, walking further inside,

19:58.000 --> 19:59.520
every place

19:59.540 --> 20:01.650
holds memories of her and me.

20:03.030 --> 20:05.110
Look, what's that?

20:05.110 --> 20:06.110
It's so beautiful.

20:06.110 --> 20:07.200
Who made this?

20:07.220 --> 20:08.200
Setting all this up during summer break,

20:08.200 --> 20:09.530
no one's going to see it.

20:09.680 --> 20:11.030
Exactly.

20:11.050 --> 20:13.780
-The lights will look nice in the room.
-For whom?

20:14.980 --> 20:16.310
Look at that wind chime.

20:17.630 --> 20:18.390
This...

20:19.030 --> 20:21.510
What if it hits someone's face
hanging this low?

20:21.510 --> 20:22.750
Meng, wait for me.

20:22.770 --> 20:24.330
Wait, why did she leave?

20:24.450 --> 20:25.510
It's all decorated so festively,

20:25.510 --> 20:26.480
different from all the other trees.

20:26.480 --> 20:27.830
Is she not even going
to take a second look?

20:27.830 --> 20:30.130
Meng, where are you going?

20:30.350 --> 20:32.440
To the field.

20:33.300 --> 20:34.900
Going straight to the field?

20:35.240 --> 20:37.290
Don't come to the field.

20:37.460 --> 20:39.100
The field is in the back.

20:39.440 --> 20:40.880
I've got a few other surprises first.

20:40.880 --> 20:41.680
Going to see

20:41.680 --> 20:43.540
the surprise you prepared for me.

20:43.920 --> 20:44.880
What surprise?

20:44.880 --> 20:46.240
There's no surprise.

20:46.270 --> 20:48.440
There definitely is. I guessed it.

20:48.440 --> 20:48.880
Remember to

20:48.880 --> 20:49.920
cover my eyes later.

20:49.920 --> 20:51.160
I love surprises.

20:51.160 --> 20:52.350
Slow down. Slow down.

20:52.350 --> 20:54.530
Please. I beg you.

20:54.790 --> 20:56.610
In the middle of the field,

20:56.740 --> 20:58.540
that's the main event.

20:59.640 --> 21:01.500
You make your grand entrance too.

21:02.580 --> 21:04.370
I'll be over here.

21:04.400 --> 21:06.050
Then you pull me over.

21:06.200 --> 21:06.720
Hurry, hurry.

21:06.720 --> 21:08.180
Pull me over. Pull me over.

21:08.250 --> 21:09.070
Then put the gift

21:09.070 --> 21:09.960
in my hands

21:10.600 --> 21:12.060
and push me in front of her.

21:14.410 --> 21:15.130
Gu Meng.

21:15.590 --> 21:16.520
Happy birthday.

21:18.440 --> 21:19.450
Impossible.

21:19.470 --> 21:20.380
I can't do it.

21:20.830 --> 21:21.830
Why?

21:23.920 --> 21:25.570
It'll be around 35 degrees that day.

21:25.570 --> 21:26.750
You want me to wear this?

21:26.750 --> 21:28.540
Are you trying to roast me alive, bro?

21:28.540 --> 21:30.160
Besides, I have other things to do.

21:30.160 --> 21:30.840
What is it?

21:30.870 --> 21:32.300
Is it more important than my business?

21:32.300 --> 21:33.450
My portfolio.

21:34.160 --> 21:35.000
Before I meet the professor,

21:35.000 --> 21:36.530
I need to prepare a bit more.

21:37.630 --> 21:39.330
That is indeed important.

21:41.230 --> 21:42.030
It's fine.

21:42.740 --> 21:43.440
How about this?

21:43.440 --> 21:45.390
I'll trouble the security guard a bit.

21:45.390 --> 21:46.880
I'll ask him to help out.

21:49.350 --> 21:50.480
Where are you? Where are you?

21:50.480 --> 21:52.210
The captain is looking for you.

21:53.960 --> 21:54.640
I... I...

21:54.640 --> 21:55.270
I'm in the restroom.

21:55.270 --> 21:56.590
I'll be right there.

21:58.250 --> 21:59.230
Bro.

22:01.160 --> 22:02.090
Bro.

22:03.600 --> 22:05.310
Answer the phone.

22:07.050 --> 22:08.200
Where is he?

22:08.740 --> 22:11.070
He's even more unreliable than Lu Xixiao.

22:14.410 --> 22:15.160
Darn.

22:16.410 --> 22:18.180
The phone battery dies so fast.

22:26.520 --> 22:28.470
Hey, is anyone there?

22:33.420 --> 22:34.750
Come on, feet. Stop getting in the way.

22:34.750 --> 22:36.680
There's not enough oxygen as it is.

22:37.970 --> 22:39.170
Is anybody there?

22:44.610 --> 22:47.920
Hey, is anyone there?

22:49.540 --> 22:51.660
Someone is trapped here.

22:52.360 --> 22:54.150
Help me!

22:54.890 --> 22:57.100
Security guard!

23:01.400 --> 23:02.480
What is it?

23:02.480 --> 23:03.880
We're almost there.

23:05.060 --> 23:05.860
Three.

23:07.000 --> 23:07.630
Two.

23:09.550 --> 23:10.070
One.

23:16.250 --> 23:17.710
Did you do this, Wan?

23:19.030 --> 23:20.360
Please watch the video.

23:21.240 --> 23:23.110
Is anyone there?

23:23.910 --> 23:25.500
I don't want to die.

23:26.730 --> 23:28.390
Help!

23:29.620 --> 23:31.710
Don't worry, you won't die.

23:32.570 --> 23:33.370
Xixiao?

23:36.610 --> 23:37.440
Xixiao.

23:37.680 --> 23:38.350
I knew

23:38.350 --> 23:39.750
you wouldn't abandon me.

23:39.880 --> 23:42.210
Hurry, push me over.

23:45.590 --> 23:46.400
Stop crying.

23:47.260 --> 23:47.930
Don't tell them

23:47.930 --> 23:49.330
I was the one who came to save you today.

23:49.330 --> 23:50.960
Or else you'd be dead.

23:51.110 --> 23:53.170
This was all Jiang Fan's idea, right?

23:53.830 --> 23:55.350
You guys are too good to me.

23:55.350 --> 23:56.440
This is so beautiful.

23:56.440 --> 23:58.400
How much did you spend?

23:58.400 --> 23:59.790
And all these flowers.

24:02.500 --> 24:04.590
Such a big box.

24:04.610 --> 24:06.930
Did you get me a car?

24:09.310 --> 24:10.310
I love it.

24:11.640 --> 24:13.670
Jiang Fan, you're dead!

24:13.690 --> 24:14.890
How long have you kept this from me?

24:14.890 --> 24:15.820
I'll hit you!

24:15.920 --> 24:16.440
Wait, wait.

24:16.440 --> 24:17.440
Let me look at you.

24:18.390 --> 24:20.910
Let's look at the birthday gift first.

24:37.720 --> 24:38.440
Gu Meng.

24:39.060 --> 24:39.990
Happy birthday.

24:56.700 --> 24:58.630
It wasn't supposed to be like this.

25:01.130 --> 25:02.470
It's okay, it's okay.

25:02.640 --> 25:04.000
This cake was originally very pretty.

25:04.000 --> 25:05.240
Now it has melted...

25:06.360 --> 25:07.360
It looks too ugly.

25:07.920 --> 25:08.840
Beautiful.

25:09.200 --> 25:09.770
You...

25:10.310 --> 25:11.770
It's not beautiful at all.

25:12.410 --> 25:13.900
-Sir. Sir. Let’s go.
-And this...

25:13.900 --> 25:15.830
-Let's go.
-box is not supposed to be like this.

25:15.830 --> 25:17.830
This is cool.

25:20.030 --> 25:20.640
I had this box

25:20.640 --> 25:21.590
custom-made,

25:21.590 --> 25:22.850
and it took a long time.

25:23.000 --> 25:24.000
Okay, okay, okay.

25:24.440 --> 25:26.070
I spent all my lucky money...

25:28.550 --> 25:30.070
This is very cool.

25:30.890 --> 25:32.720
The fog machine broke,

25:32.720 --> 25:34.420
and it kept pumping out
fog inside the box.

25:34.420 --> 25:35.110
I was in there,

25:35.110 --> 25:36.910
unable to catch my breath at all.

25:38.810 --> 25:40.680
Everything today was supposed to be

25:40.680 --> 25:42.550
very, very romantic.

25:43.790 --> 25:44.830
It's so romantic.

25:45.420 --> 25:47.350
So surprising. So cool.

25:55.050 --> 25:55.550
Sir.

25:55.550 --> 25:56.960
Why are you still at work?

25:59.740 --> 26:01.400
The school gate is over there.

26:06.700 --> 26:08.110
I'll walk with you.

26:28.980 --> 26:31.110
Sir, are you hot?

26:31.140 --> 26:32.870
Let me buy you a bottle of water.

26:35.200 --> 26:36.240
It's so hot today.

26:36.240 --> 26:37.900
This job must be hard.

26:38.070 --> 26:39.620
Let's get some water to cool you down,

26:39.620 --> 26:40.560
just to cool off.

26:41.750 --> 26:43.160
Why don't you take off the headgear?

26:43.160 --> 26:44.310
It must be so hot.

26:45.350 --> 26:46.210
Aren't you hot?

26:46.920 --> 26:48.640
Okay, there's a convenience store ahead.

26:48.640 --> 26:50.370
Let me get you a bottle of water.

26:51.000 --> 26:52.130
How does that sound?

26:59.990 --> 27:01.070
Even though it melted,

27:01.070 --> 27:02.330
it's still delicious.

27:11.820 --> 27:12.450
Gu Meng.

27:13.220 --> 27:13.860
I like you.

27:13.890 --> 27:14.650
Be with me.

27:23.400 --> 27:23.920
No.

27:25.320 --> 27:26.190
Why?

27:26.810 --> 27:28.390
You're always so impulsive.

27:28.390 --> 27:29.920
Saying you like me on a whim.

27:31.990 --> 27:33.200
You spent so much money

27:33.200 --> 27:34.430
setting up this venue.

27:34.430 --> 27:36.300
How will you support me in the future?

27:36.300 --> 27:37.240
This...

27:37.530 --> 27:39.110
It was all spent on you.

27:39.640 --> 27:40.440
Besides,

27:40.460 --> 27:41.110
we will be in

27:41.110 --> 27:42.590
a long-distance relationship.

27:42.590 --> 27:44.330
I don't want a long-distance relationship.

27:44.330 --> 27:44.770
I...

27:45.120 --> 27:45.750
When I have free time,

27:45.750 --> 27:47.080
I can fly over to see you.

27:50.240 --> 27:50.850
No.

28:10.160 --> 28:12.170
[Where are you?]

28:16.770 --> 28:19.130
[Youke Convenience Store]

28:19.300 --> 28:22.660
[I'm outside.]

28:27.790 --> 28:30.750
[Youke Convenience Store]

28:30.050 --> 28:32.790
Sir, it must be hard
for you to open the can.

28:32.790 --> 28:33.990
Let me open it for you.

28:39.380 --> 28:40.240
[Youke Convenience Store]

28:45.280 --> 28:47.140
Didn't you say you wouldn't come?

28:49.020 --> 28:50.400
It's because Jiang Fan begged me

28:50.400 --> 28:51.100
to come.

28:52.570 --> 28:53.970
How did you know it was me?

28:54.920 --> 28:55.590
In our school,

28:55.590 --> 28:57.480
there's no security guard as tall as you.

28:55.680 --> 29:00.110
[Youke Convenience Store]

29:00.200 --> 29:02.600
That mascot costume suits you pretty well.

29:03.510 --> 29:04.510
Thanks a lot.

29:09.610 --> 29:10.410
Good news?

29:13.470 --> 29:14.280
Hard to say.

29:16.640 --> 29:18.170
What about your portfolio?

29:21.780 --> 29:22.600
Yeah.

29:22.810 --> 29:24.210
What about my portfolio?

29:25.400 --> 29:26.200
Jiang Fan was supposed to

29:26.200 --> 29:27.530
return this favor to me.

29:28.450 --> 29:29.300
But he bailed.

29:35.060 --> 29:36.330
So you're taking over.

29:43.560 --> 29:44.690
Let's go back first.

29:59.500 --> 30:01.140
What are you doing? Let's take a cab.

30:01.140 --> 30:02.810
Taking a cab is a waste of money.

30:02.810 --> 30:05.340
We can enjoy the breeze
and get some fresh air.

30:06.850 --> 30:08.450
I don't know how to ride this.

30:09.130 --> 30:10.550
You know how to ride a motorcycle,

30:10.550 --> 30:12.480
but you don't know how to ride this?

30:12.550 --> 30:13.510
I'm just not used to

30:13.510 --> 30:14.840
riding behind someone.

30:17.860 --> 30:19.350
Stop pretending.

30:19.380 --> 30:21.440
It's not like I haven't
given you a ride before.

30:21.440 --> 30:22.050
Get on.

30:27.290 --> 30:28.820
Do you even know how to ride?

30:34.740 --> 30:36.940
How dare you question my riding skills?

30:43.600 --> 30:44.990
You're too heavy.

30:45.010 --> 30:46.640
Me? Heavy?

30:46.770 --> 30:48.230
Hold on tight.

30:49.170 --> 30:50.710
Slow down on the downhill.

30:51.920 --> 30:53.520
Such a happy moment.

30:54.910 --> 30:55.490
Look at the camera.

30:55.490 --> 30:56.200
What're you doing?

30:56.200 --> 30:57.200
I'm recording it.

30:57.220 --> 30:58.190
Delete it.

30:58.790 --> 31:00.340
♪ The warm night breeze ♪

31:01.680 --> 31:02.890
Look, you have
a little antenna on your head.

31:02.170 --> 31:04.020
♪ Has filled the corridor ♪

31:02.920 --> 31:03.680
See?

31:05.560 --> 31:07.110
♪ Wet clothes ♪

31:08.170 --> 31:10.630
♪ Flowing waves ♪

31:12.270 --> 31:14.530
♪ Don't think about tomorrow ♪

31:15.650 --> 31:17.880
♪ Look away in the next second ♪

31:18.910 --> 31:20.630
♪ Tell a long joke ♪

31:20.740 --> 31:21.800
Look at the camera.

31:22.400 --> 31:24.630
♪ Fill up all the cracks ♪

31:22.850 --> 31:23.910
Look at the camera.

31:25.720 --> 31:28.310
♪ I don't want to live a wandering life ♪

31:28.850 --> 31:31.060
[Public Security]

31:29.290 --> 31:31.390
♪ I don't care what belief he has ♪

31:29.950 --> 31:31.150
Where's your helmet?

31:32.860 --> 31:34.950
♪ What does the world
have to do with me? ♪

31:34.050 --> 31:35.250
Is this a helmet?

31:36.370 --> 31:38.170
♪ It's getting late ♪

31:37.880 --> 31:39.280
I can't see when I wear it.

31:39.510 --> 31:40.400
You can't carry a passenger on a scooter.

31:39.710 --> 31:41.060
♪ His obsession ♪

31:40.420 --> 31:41.420
Did you know that?

31:41.950 --> 31:43.560
I'm sorry, officer.

31:43.900 --> 31:45.170
I won't do it again.

31:46.010 --> 31:49.360
[Public Security]

31:46.470 --> 31:47.230
I'm sorry.

31:47.890 --> 31:49.690
You dare think about a next time?

31:50.570 --> 31:52.030
There won't be a next time.

32:06.920 --> 32:14.740
[Time Store]

32:18.500 --> 32:19.560
Give me the helmet.

32:22.370 --> 32:27.500
[Time Store]

32:22.990 --> 32:24.470
It's so beautiful here.

32:24.950 --> 32:25.810
Not bad, right?

32:26.590 --> 32:27.440
Xixiao?

32:27.640 --> 32:28.880
What brings you here?

32:29.480 --> 32:30.550
Mr. Li.

32:31.440 --> 32:32.370
Long time no see.

32:34.030 --> 32:35.230
You've grown taller.

32:37.650 --> 32:38.650
Go sit over there.

32:38.650 --> 32:40.020
I'll get you some drinks.

32:40.020 --> 32:43.520
[Time Store]

32:40.110 --> 32:40.720
Okay.

32:40.740 --> 32:43.140
Have a seat. Make yourselves comfortable.

32:52.510 --> 32:53.000
Here.

32:53.990 --> 32:54.850
Have some soda.

32:54.880 --> 32:55.720
Thank you, Mr. Li.

32:55.720 --> 32:57.200
You treat us every time we come.

32:57.200 --> 32:58.910
Aren't you running a business?

32:58.910 --> 32:59.590
Before,

32:59.710 --> 33:01.320
you gave the kids so many things

33:01.320 --> 33:02.450
and didn't ask for money.

33:02.450 --> 33:04.320
Plus, you brought a friend today.

33:04.680 --> 33:06.410
I must show some appreciation.

33:07.120 --> 33:08.980
Mr. Li, can I go in and look around?

33:09.040 --> 33:10.240
Go ahead. Look around.

33:10.240 --> 33:11.040
Thank you.

33:13.730 --> 33:14.960
How have you been lately?

33:14.960 --> 33:15.770
Pretty good.

33:16.320 --> 33:17.210
Same as always?

33:17.240 --> 33:19.110
Yeah, pretty much the same.

33:23.430 --> 33:25.390
Are you here to paint today?

33:26.440 --> 33:28.400
There are so many paintings here.

33:28.420 --> 33:29.420
So beautiful.

33:29.550 --> 33:30.690
These were all painted

33:30.690 --> 33:31.820
by Xixiao's mother.

33:33.480 --> 33:34.280
Sir.

33:35.640 --> 33:36.250
Coming right up.

33:36.250 --> 33:37.460
Sit tight for a bit.

33:37.570 --> 33:38.810
Come, sit here.

33:51.650 --> 33:53.980
Did you come here often
when you were a kid?

33:55.460 --> 33:56.440
I did.

33:58.320 --> 33:59.120
Stop looking.

34:00.370 --> 34:02.850
The little boy in the painting
is you, right?

34:06.760 --> 34:10.159
Do not ask.

34:14.659 --> 34:15.760
I can tell your mother

34:15.760 --> 34:16.960
loved you very much.

34:24.610 --> 34:25.520
It's all fake.

34:29.420 --> 34:30.150
Fake?

34:32.110 --> 34:32.920
Didn't she just

34:32.920 --> 34:34.050
leave me here alone?

34:36.440 --> 34:38.639
-Xixiao, help me.
-What’s wrong, Muyi?

34:38.820 --> 34:39.850
What's wrong?

34:56.270 --> 34:57.750
How about we get another one
from the store?

34:57.750 --> 34:59.360
My dad said he won't be restocking

34:59.360 --> 35:00.320
for a week.

35:01.150 --> 35:02.150
This is the last kite

35:02.150 --> 35:03.500
in my dad's store.

35:03.630 --> 35:04.760
Isn't that perfect?

35:06.770 --> 35:08.360
Muyi, you're so young.

35:08.360 --> 35:09.760
Flying a kite is dangerous.

35:09.760 --> 35:11.690
Let me take you to play in the water.

35:11.880 --> 35:13.480
I don't want to play in the water.

35:13.480 --> 35:15.030
I want to fly a kite.

35:15.030 --> 35:15.840
Xixiao,

35:16.010 --> 35:18.300
just climb the tree and get it for me.

35:18.330 --> 35:19.590
Please.

35:19.880 --> 35:21.150
Please.

35:21.840 --> 35:22.480
I...

35:23.800 --> 35:25.330
Please.

35:28.430 --> 35:29.070
Zhou Wan.

35:31.510 --> 35:34.240
You don't need Xixiao for tree climbing.

35:36.840 --> 35:37.510
Be careful.

35:40.280 --> 35:41.110
Be careful.

35:41.780 --> 35:43.110
What should you call me?

35:43.230 --> 35:44.190
Ms. Wan.

35:45.130 --> 35:46.470
Ms. Wan, come on!

35:48.880 --> 35:49.880
Be careful.

35:58.650 --> 36:00.080
Ms. Wan, you are awesome.

36:01.520 --> 36:02.600
Got it.

36:11.250 --> 36:13.700
♪ I'mma take a frozen heart ♪

36:15.090 --> 36:16.940
♪ Someone's gonna make it ♪

36:17.720 --> 36:20.390
♪ In the building of my broken part ♪

36:21.960 --> 36:23.590
♪ Someone's gonna fix it ♪

36:25.000 --> 36:26.630
Ms. Wan, you got the kite.

36:25.190 --> 36:28.260
♪ I'm the only one guy
with the ten things crime ♪

36:26.630 --> 36:27.760
You're amazing.

36:29.090 --> 36:32.360
♪ I deserve a sanction in my mind ♪

36:29.770 --> 36:30.830
Be careful, Muyi.

36:30.850 --> 36:31.740
Got it.

36:33.620 --> 36:34.900
You scared me to death.

36:34.620 --> 36:36.020
♪ Nescience doesn't mean ♪

36:36.050 --> 36:37.110
♪ That I can fly ♪

36:40.470 --> 36:41.290
Thank you.

36:40.490 --> 36:42.730
♪ But I never seem to close ♪

36:42.760 --> 36:44.240
♪ The dormer lock ♪

36:47.120 --> 36:48.290
♪ Telling you how the sky above the roof ♪

36:47.150 --> 36:47.670
Run.

36:47.700 --> 36:48.140
Run.

36:48.170 --> 36:48.880
Run.

36:48.310 --> 36:49.560
♪ Is full of stars ♪

36:50.660 --> 36:52.150
So high.

36:52.440 --> 36:53.440
It's flying.

36:55.040 --> 36:56.290
Watch me.

36:58.510 --> 36:59.550
This is my first time seeing

36:59.550 --> 37:01.190
Lu Xixiao so relaxed.

37:02.040 --> 37:03.290
This is Xixiao's

37:03.500 --> 37:05.430
first time bringing someone here.

37:05.670 --> 37:06.670
I can tell

37:06.850 --> 37:08.120
he likes you a lot.

37:10.060 --> 37:11.230
Really?

37:11.630 --> 37:12.470
In the past,

37:12.810 --> 37:14.610
his mother used to bring him here

37:14.710 --> 37:16.840
to draw that big hackberry tree.

37:19.070 --> 37:21.330
After something happened to his family,

37:21.750 --> 37:22.980
he became all alone.

37:25.100 --> 37:27.690
He would sit under the tree all day long.

37:28.940 --> 37:30.980
This kid is very lonely.

37:31.980 --> 37:34.040
If you ask him, he won't say anything.

37:34.400 --> 37:35.590
But I can tell

37:36.110 --> 37:38.400
he's much more cheerful than before.

37:40.690 --> 37:41.900
If his mother

37:42.060 --> 37:43.540
could see him now,

37:43.700 --> 37:45.700
she would definitely be very happy.

37:48.510 --> 37:49.110
I...

37:50.810 --> 37:52.280
I'm going to fly the kite for a bit too.

37:52.280 --> 37:52.810
Go ahead.

38:13.040 --> 38:14.900
[Time Store]

38:52.200 --> 38:53.320
So you came here this time

38:53.320 --> 38:54.320
because you've decided what to paint

38:54.320 --> 38:55.550
for Professor Qin?

38:59.480 --> 39:00.510
I guess so.

39:02.340 --> 39:03.600
Although it's the same scenery,

39:03.600 --> 39:04.250
I...

39:05.860 --> 39:07.990
I just feel that coming back this time,

39:08.920 --> 39:10.920
I can paint differently from my mom.

39:25.060 --> 39:27.420
Is there anything I can help you with?

39:36.200 --> 39:37.600
Then I won't disturb you.

39:40.770 --> 39:42.170
Just stay here with me.

40:02.860 --> 40:04.110
What kind of person

40:04.110 --> 40:05.150
was your mother?

40:13.780 --> 40:15.180
I can't really remember.

40:21.140 --> 40:21.940
I understand.

40:24.150 --> 40:25.320
Sometimes

40:25.760 --> 40:26.530
I also can't remember

40:26.530 --> 40:27.860
what my dad looked like.

40:29.930 --> 40:31.360
Whenever this happens,

40:31.840 --> 40:33.000
I get really scared.

40:35.980 --> 40:36.840
I'm afraid that one day

40:36.840 --> 40:38.170
I will truly forget him.

40:43.590 --> 40:45.400
The sound of his voice

40:46.670 --> 40:48.880
and the traces of him in my life

40:49.760 --> 40:51.080
are fading away.

40:52.500 --> 40:54.700
But the older I get, the more certain I am

40:56.390 --> 40:57.320
that he loved me.

41:03.400 --> 41:04.280
Maybe it's just because

41:04.280 --> 41:05.540
your memory has faded.

41:06.560 --> 41:08.620
Sometimes, the blurrier the memory,

41:08.960 --> 41:10.480
the more it beautifies...

41:10.500 --> 41:11.300
No.

41:13.140 --> 41:14.660
Actions don't lie.

41:15.280 --> 41:16.590
If you really didn't believe

41:16.590 --> 41:17.850
your mother loves you,

41:18.400 --> 41:20.490
why would you miss her so much

41:21.940 --> 41:24.070
and come back here time and time again?

42:42.160 --> 42:42.950
Finished?

43:02.110 --> 43:03.590
Is this a drawing of...

43:06.000 --> 43:06.810
How is it?

43:14.080 --> 43:15.440
You're my inspiration.
